{"id": 900719925474099312345, "ok": true, "cmd": "polar", "ucas": "polar 1 + I", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "polar", "input": "1 + I", "exponential": "sqrt(2)*e^(i*pi/4)", "trigonometric": "sqrt(2)*(cos(pi/4) + i*sin(pi/4))", "r": "sqrt(2)", "theta": "pi/4"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "value", "points": 1, "max_diff": 1.570092458683775e-16, "passed": true}, {"kind": "value", "points": 1, "max_diff": 1.570092458683775e-16, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "1 + I = sqrt(2)*e^(i*pi/4)\n  = sqrt(2)*(cos(pi/4) + i*sin(pi/4))\n  r = |z| = sqrt(2),  theta = arg z = pi/4\n  theta is the principal argument, -pi < theta <= pi\n  check: equal numerically (1 + 1i, complex arithmetic)\n  check: equal numerically (1 + 1i, complex arithmetic)\n"}
