{"id": 5, "ok": true, "cmd": "algebra", "ucas": "algebra octonion", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "algebra", "commutative": "no: e1 e2 = e3 but e2 e1 = -e3", "associative": "no: (e1 e2) e4 = e7 but e1 (e2 e4) = -e7", "alternative": "yes ((aa)b = a(ab), (ba)a = b(aa) at 200 random pairs); by Artin's theorem any two elements generate an associative subalgebra", "flexible_and_power_associative": "yes ((ab)a = a(ba); powers a^n are well defined), as in every Cayley-Dickson algebra", "normed_a_composition_algebra": "yes, |ab| = |a||b| at 200 random pairs (Degen's eight-square identity)", "a_division_algebra": "yes, ab = 0 only when a = 0 or b = 0 (it is normed); by Hurwitz, R, C, H and O are the only normed division algebras", "inverses": "every a != 0 has a^-1 = conj(a)/|a|^2 (a a^-1 = 1, checked); a^-1(ab) = b holds (alternativity)", "conjugation": "conj(ab) = conj(b) conj(a) (checked); a conj(a) = |a|^2", "headline": "the octonions: dimension 8 over the reals, basis 1, e1, e2, e3, e4, e5, e6, e7"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "the octonions: dimension 8 over the reals, basis 1, e1, e2, e3, e4, e5, e6, e7\n  commutative: no: e1 e2 = e3 but e2 e1 = -e3\n  associative: no: (e1 e2) e4 = e7 but e1 (e2 e4) = -e7\n  alternative: yes ((aa)b = a(ab), (ba)a = b(aa) at 200 random pairs); by Artin's theorem any two elements generate an associative subalgebra\n  flexible and power-associative: yes ((ab)a = a(ba); powers a^n are well defined), as in every Cayley-Dickson algebra\n  normed (a composition algebra): yes, |ab| = |a||b| at 200 random pairs (Degen's eight-square identity)\n  a division algebra: yes, ab = 0 only when a = 0 or b = 0 (it is normed); by Hurwitz, R, C, H and O are the only normed division algebras\n  inverses: every a != 0 has a^-1 = conj(a)/|a|^2 (a a^-1 = 1, checked); a^-1(ab) = b holds (alternativity)\n  conjugation: conj(ab) = conj(b) conj(a) (checked); a conj(a) = |a|^2\n"}
